# OksaSDR tour, "On the air": each mode heard as it is, iPad landscape 1366x1024.
# A template: make-modes.py fills {SSB_MHZ} {SSB_NOTE} {CW_MHZ} {CW_NOTE} {DV_MHZ} {DV_NOTE}
# from the spots of the moment (the DX cluster, FreeDV Reporter). Receive only; RADE on makes the
# slice the TX slice for a while (no transmission). Put back on 14.074 DIGU at the end.
pin 5
record 15
caption !speed 3
caption # On the air
caption Each mode as it sounds on the band right now, live from the radio.
ready
wait 4000
caption !speed 1
caption SSB: tap the frequency and type it.
caption !mark 240,145
frequency-dialog
wait 1500
keys {SSB_MHZ}
wait 1500
keys <Enter>
wait 1500
taptext DIGU
wait 2000
taptext USB ~442,159
wait 2500
caption {SSB_NOTE}
wait 20000
caption CW: the CW section shows the decoder's text as it copies.
taptext CW ~1263,82
taptext View ~1324,82
freq {CW_MHZ}
wait 1000
taptext USB
wait 2000
taptext CW ~510,159
wait 3000
caption {CW_NOTE}
wait 22000
taptext FreeDV ~1263,141
taptext CW ~1263,82
caption FreeDV: RADE digital voice, decoded in the app.
freq {DV_MHZ}
mode DIGU
wait 2500
tapname radeButton
wait 3000
caption {DV_NOTE}
wait 30000
tapname radeButton
wait 3000
taptext View ~1324,82
taptext FreeDV ~1263,141
caption -
record off
freq 14.074
mode DIGU
wait 2000
slices
